# "This land enters tapped unless your opponents control eight or more lands" counts every opponent's lands together.
# Three players: on turn 10 Bot2 and Bot3 have three lands each, six in all, so Bot1's Turbulent Fen enters tapped; on
# turn 13 they have four each, eight in all, so its Turbulent Moor enters untapped. A count of one opponent's lands
# (four) or of its controller's own (four) would tap the Moor.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp x3
Turbulent Fen
Turbulent Moor
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x12

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Turbulent Fen.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turbulent Fen.Tapped = true
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot3.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Turbulent Moor.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turbulent Moor.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Turn = 13
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot3.Battlefield.Count = 4
